# .mailmap: one canonical identity for this repository.
#
# The history carries four spellings of the same author: a local machine
# identity, two GitHub noreply addresses, and the primary address. This file
# collapses them for every tool that honours a mailmap: `git shortlog -sne`,
# `git log --use-mailmap`, `git blame`, and GitHub's blame view.
#
# NOTE: GitHub's repository "Contributors" panel does NOT read .mailmap. It
# counts commit-author e-mail addresses and `Co-Authored-By:` trailers straight
# from the object store, so that panel only changes if the history itself is
# rewritten. See CONTRIBUTING.md § Commit identity.

